{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"unusual","reason":"A sixth repeated call that never returns delays loop detection until another event or timeout, leaving the run stuck in the meantime."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"After the earlier result is evicted, a changed polling result is counted as a repeat and can stop the agent prematurely."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"When the last of six parallel identical calls returns first, unresolved calls can be counted as repeats and cause progressing work to be aborted."}]}